## DESIGN SYSTEM INTEL (UI/UX PRO MAX)
- Location: .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/
- Whenever modifying or creating HTML files, verify structural hierarchy against the rules in 'ui-reasoning.csv'.
- Enforce the following strict boundaries for Equinox AV v2.1:
  * Primary Style: Premium Service Minimalism / Content-First Dark Mode.
  * Typography: Preserve Newsreader Serif headers paired with clean Sans-serif body prose.
  * Spatial Rule: Maintain 15rem vertical "Max Breath" margins for core elements.
  * Animation: Global cross-document view transitions locked at 350ms.
- ANTI-PATTERNS TO ENFORCE (SILENTLY ABORT IF DETECTED):
  * No trend-chasing visual clutter (No neumorphism or heavy gradient meshes).
  * No generic "AI Indigo" or purple-to-pink highlights.
  * No emojis used as standalone icons; always use crisp semantic SVGs.
  * No layout shifts; ensure image containers have explicit aspect ratios or width parameters.

