# Equinox Audio Visuals — Project Rules

This is a static, multi-page marketing site (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, no build step).
Design tokens live in `stable-header.css` `:root`; v2 component styles live in
`design-system-v2.css` and are scoped to `.v2` on `<body>`.

When making design or layout changes, consult the DESIGN SYSTEM INTEL block above
and the local UX guidelines under `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/` before editing.
